  "details": "So we all know with facebooks new video that they are rebranding and calling them selves “meta” which will open the world of VR gaming. Where does leave the VRchat community when this launches??\nI believe that In order to get ahead of Facebook and really take this game/lifestyle to a whole new level, VRChat should create NFT’s. Partnering with clothing lines or creating their own NFT’s so that you could wear or equip NFTs you have purchased. \nImagine, purchasing an Excalibur limited to only the first 2000 buyers which could be sold or bought online. Then later pulling out the Excalibur in game!! Same with clothing.\nYou make money off every nft through every transaction (a portion gets transferred to you with every transaction)  \nRegardless, this is the future of vr gaming, let’s get ahead and start to ensure that our community remains ahead and populous. \nThank you for your time \nStrongBlacWomen",
